// @vibe/compiler/codegen/wasm_emit — ADR-0070 / #897 compiler-internal contract.
// Directory-shared-scope package: wasm_emit.vibe (facade, re-exports the bulk
// of the surface via sections.vibe/instructions.vibe/builders.vibe/simd.vibe/
// simd_patterns.vibe) plus the directory's other members that the facade
// re-export chain passes through or that carry their own top-level exports
// not surfaced by the facade: sections.vibe -> base.vibe -> {code_helpers.vibe,
// header_types.vibe -> {header_core.vibe -> {header_magic.vibe,
// header_type_sections.vibe}, header_exports.vibe}} (pure re-export shims,
// no signatures of their own) and extra.vibe / metadata.vibe (leaf
// definitions reached only via the sections.vibe re-export chain). Every
// top-level `export fn` across every file in this directory is declared
// below, per the directory-membership rule (not just wasm_emit.vibe's own
// re-exports) — including emit_simd_skip_whitespace_16 /
// emit_simd_is_identifier_char_16 in simd_patterns.vibe, which are directory
// members but are NOT re-exported through the facade.

// -- code_helpers.vibe (via base.vibe <- sections.vibe) --
